Around View Monitor and MOD Market FAQs
What is an Around View Monitor (AVM)?
An Around View Monitor is a car safety technology that provides a 360-degree view of the vehicle's surroundings, helping drivers to park and maneuver more easily.

What is MOD in the context of the automotive industry?
MOD stands for Moving Object Detection, a feature that helps drivers detect and avoid potential collisions with moving objects around the vehicle.

How is the Around View Monitor and MOD Market expected to grow in the next 5 years?
According to our market research, the AVM and MOD market is projected to grow at a CAGR of 15% over the next 5 years.

